  "id": "voltage",
  "neon": "#5cd6ff",
  "note": "The density probe, re-cut as a STEPPED building rather than a box wearing greebles. Five masses — plinth, forward wing, main block, set-back upper, roof house — so the silhouette changes four times going up, which is what the Meridian does and what the first cut did not. The signage is structural now: a rooftop gantry standing on its own legs where a board used to hover over the roof on two hairline pipes, and two bladePanels with real edge returns where two screen-space neonBlades used to float in front of the wall. RENDER_TUNE.legacyArms puts the nightclub arm back.",
  "pal": "ty_voltage",
  "replaces": "nightclub",
